IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`
IMPORT `P4-annex-vii`

-- Tests of Annex VII (consolidated lines 1800 to 1839). Expected values are written from the text.
-- ON is 2 August 2026 for a system classified under Article 6(2) and Annex III, placed on the market on 1 January 2030, not changed.
-- BEFORE is 1 August 2026, the day before the general date of application; AFTER is 1 December 2026.
-- SAVED is a system placed on 1 January 2020 and not changed (saved by Article 111(2)); CHANGED the same system after a significant change.
-- NEITHER is a system that is not high-risk.
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: every assertion and trace below that used ON, BEFORE, AFTER, SAVED, CHANGED or NEITHER now passes two further gate inputs (FALSE, FALSE); no expected value changed.
-- Every function takes six inputs before its own: the four above, then the Section B flag and the integration flag of the keel's Article 2(2); ON, BEFORE, AFTER, SAVED, CHANGED and NEITHER give both FALSE.
-- The group function of Annex VII keeps the first four only (ON4, BEFORE4 and so on).
-- SECB is 2 August 2026 for a system classified under Article 6(1) and Annex I whose products are covered by the legislation listed in Section B of Annex I, not integrated in it:
-- Article 2(2) then lets only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 apply, so Article 43 and Annex VII do not (fork F-S14-reach).

§ `The group of Annex VII`

#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2035) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 1 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 2(2) and Annex VII`

-- The keel's Article 2(2) answers JUST FALSE for Article 43 where the route is Article 6(1) with Annex I and the products are covered by Section B; NOTHING where it does not speak (another route, products not in Section B, or Chapter I not yet applying).
#ASSERT `Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` (Date 1 1 2025) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Integration (Articles 57, 58 and 59 apply "only in so far as" the requirements have been integrated) does not change the answer for Article 43.
#ASSERT `Annex VII Article 2(2) cuts Article 43 off from the AI system` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- Before the group applies the answer is NOTHING first (the keel's rule), and a saved system is outside the group.
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 1 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 1 2030) FALSE TRUE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
